      "lines": [
        "$P_9=9\\times P_8=9\\times40320=362880$;",
        "$P_{10}=10\\times P_9=10\\times362880=3628800$;",
        "$P_{11}=11\\times P_{10}=11\\times3628800=39916800$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例如，安排$11$位客人在$11$把椅子上就座，可以有",
        "$39916800$种方法."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "由公式(1)得出（参看第19题），一般地说，$n$个元素的全",
        "排列总数$P_n$等于前$n$个自然数的乘积：",
        "$P_n=1\\times2\\times3\\times\\cdots\\times n$.　$(2)$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "前$n$个自然数的乘积，通常用一种特殊的符号表示：$n!$",
        "（读作“$n$的阶乘”）. 利用这个符号，公式(2)可以改写成",
        "$P_n=n!$　$(3)$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "为使以后叙述简便，规定空集只能用一种方法排列，即",
        "$P_0=1$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "这时，公式(1)对于$n=1$也适用：",
        "$P_1=1\\times P_0=1$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "exhead",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "习题"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "32",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "32. 用集合$A$的元素组成一切可能的全排列，如果：",
        "а) $A=\\{1\\}$;　б) $A=\\{7,8\\}$;",
        "в) $A=\\{a,b,c\\}$;　г) $A=\\{m,n,p,q\\}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "33",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "33. 用红、蓝、白三种颜色的横布条，可以拼成多少种不同的",
        "三色旗？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "34",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "34. 证明公式（设$n>m$）：",
        "а) $\\frac{(m+3)!}{m!}=(m+1)(m+2)(m+3)$;"
      ]
